{"id":300,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自立と教養を育てる日本女子大附属","feature_description":"生涯教育の流れの中で、自立の精神と確かな教養を身につけることを掲げる一貫教育校です。研究、音楽祭、夏合宿、スポーツデーなどの行事も示され、学びと学校生活を両面から確認しやすい構成です。附属中学校とのつながりも見え、学校像を把握しやすいです。学校紹介、学校生活、行事、進路、部活動の導線がそろっており、入学後の姿を想像しやすい学校です。","clubs":[{"id":4510,"name":"囲碁クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4511,"name":"イラストクラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4512,"name":"演劇クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4513,"name":"かるたクラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4514,"name":"クッキングクラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4515,"name":"軽音楽クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4516,"name":"弦楽クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4517,"name":"コーラスクラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4518,"name":"写真クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4519,"name":"書道クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4520,"name":"吹奏楽クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4521,"name":"生物クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jwu.ac.jp/hsc/h-campus/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4522,"name":"美術クラブ","category":